# The VS Code extension, example workspace and benchmark under the root
# `lsp/` directory are development tooling and are not part of the published
# `apollovm` package. The leading `/` anchors the pattern to the package root
# so that `lib/src/lsp/` (the LSP implementation library) IS published.
/lsp/

# NOTE: when `.pubignore` exists it REPLACES `.gitignore` for publishing,
# so relevant `.gitignore` exclusions must be repeated here.
*.exe
*.iml
.DS_Store
build/
doc/api/
articles/

# The native Wasm engine is published as its own package: apollovm_wasm.
/apollovm_wasm/
